  "doc": "rivet-motion's stations (Rivet's locomotion and bare-handed melee). Tuning keys are <table>.<path>; an array row is addressed by its index (rivet_melee.claw.hits.0 = claw_1). The course station measures the PlayerMotion feel numbers (dev/rivet_motion/motion_probe.gd prints the same ones headless); the melee line is three human dummies 2 m apart (x 0..4, y -3 in the hub) for the claw combo and a metal line 2 m apart for the shock's chain (kind metal, the arena's steel dummy; the far one sits 4 m out, past the 3 m chain radius). The melee line also tunes the melee weapons (melee_weapons.weapons.<id>..., electro_baton and katana tonight) on the same dummies. Until the arena scene is on this branch, res://dev/rivet_motion/motion_course.gd and combo_clip.gd run these.",
